00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.899
the problem with myths is that they lead
us to act in ways that we think are

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:47.129
beneficial but actually aren't they
might do nothing or they might even be

00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:50.640
actively harmful if you like watching
this sort of video I'd really

